# A level-90 sorceress with a few skills and items; a champion pack of
# fallen (monstats 19, specs/monsters/ai.md §9 table) is spawned beside
# her (scenario.md §3.1: boss spawn, champion member with umod 16,
# 1-3 champion minions, specs/monsters/population.md §6.3-§6.4); she
# selects Fire Bolt (36) and casts it at the champion. Stat ids:
# 0 strength, 1 energy, 2 dexterity, 3 vitality, 12 level, 13 experience,
# 14 gold (specs/combat/vitals.md, specs/world/npc.md §9).
scenario 1
name champion-pack
game 1.14d
seed 0x00001234
init 644409375         # game +0x7C (tools/original-hooks.md §2): the DRLG seed
difficulty hell
expansion yes
end 200

char save ScnSorNinety     # the save the original side loads (handoff §3)
char class 1
char level 90
char area 0 1
char at default
char stat 0 150
char stat 1 300
char stat 2 100
char stat 3 250
char stat 13 1200000000
char stat 14 500000
char skill 36 20       # Fire Bolt
char skill 47 20       # Fire Ball
char skill 54 1        # Teleport
char skill 56 20       # Meteor
char waypoint 1
char waypoint 3
char quest 0 1
char item oba body 4 quality unique unique 255 ilvl 85
char item uap body 1 quality rare ilvl 85 prefix 12 suffix 400 sockets 1
char item ber socket 0
char item rin inv 0 0 quality magic ilvl 70 prefix 3 suffix 50
char item hp5 belt 0

record s2c rng units stats
snapshot every 10

at 5 spawn 19 @x+12 @y champion umod 16
at 10 msg SelectSkill skill=36 left=0 item=0xFFFFFFFF
at 20 msg RightSkillOnUnit type=1 id=@1:19
at 60 msg RightSkillOnUnit type=1 id=@1:19#1
at 100 msg RightSkill x=@x+12 y=@y
